eeee   	0.90  1E-11   100  1000   SM  .true. scatter e- e- -> e- e-
#eeea  	0.40  1E-11   100  1000   SM  .true. scatter e- e- -> e- e- a
#eeeaa 	0.90  1E-11   100  1000   SM .false. scatter e- e- -> e- e- a a
